1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,440
Grey hair can be the beginning of the end. A silver signal that youth and beauty are fading and only old age remains.
白发可能是衰老的开端，这一银色信号预示着青春与美丽正在消逝，唯有岁月留存。

2
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:19,130
And while grey at 60 may not be surprising, many start to turn prematurely as young as 20.
60岁长出白发或许不足为奇，但很多人早在20岁就出现了早生华发的情况。

3
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:29,400
If we want to hide it, modern haircare products allow us to easily cover up our natural grey and preserve our youth a little longer.
如果想掩盖白发，现代护发产品能让我们轻松遮盖自然发色，将青春多保留一段时间。

4
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:37,720
But these days, many people – and women in particular, are ditching the dye to show their natural colours.
但如今，许多人——尤其是女性，开始放弃染发，展现自然发色。

5
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,750
Why?
这是为什么呢？

6
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:57,050
"Research has shown that our hair follicle production can be influenced by factors such as hormones and stress, but some people have a genetic predisposition to lose pigment or go bald more than others," says a report on the BBC website.
英国广播公司网站的一份报告称：“研究表明，毛囊的色素生成会受到激素和压力等因素影响，但有些人天生就更容易色素流失或秃顶。”

7
00:00:57,050 --> 00:01:12,140
In addition, Prof Desmond Tobin, a hair and skin pigmentation specialist at the University of Bradford in the UK, says that it is normal for people with a European background to start greying in their early 20s.
此外，英国布拉德福德大学的头发与皮肤色素专家德斯蒙德·托宾教授表示，欧洲血统的人在20岁出头开始长白发是正常现象。

8
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:22,970
Research which he participated in found that different races have different average ageing rates - with African and East-Asian backgrounds tending to whiten later.
他参与的研究发现，不同种族的平均衰老速度存在差异——非洲和东亚血统的人头发变白的时间往往更晚。

9
00:01:22,970 --> 00:01:27,970
For many men, going grey may not be a big deal.
对许多男性来说，长白发可能并不是什么大不了的事。

10
00:01:27,970 --> 00:01:38,370
It's now seen as a sign of sophistication, says UK newspaper Metro. It uses adjectives such as rugged, unique and fashionable.
英国《都市报》称，如今白发被视为成熟老练的象征，并用“粗犷、独特、时尚”等词汇来形容。

11
00:01:38,370 --> 00:01:42,620
But for many women, these qualities don't seem to apply.
但对许多女性而言，这些特质似乎并不适用。

12
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:51,900
Kate Dinota, a New Yorker who started turning grey when she was seven, states that the everyday woman feels a pressure not to age.
纽约人凯特·迪诺塔7岁就开始长白发，她说普通女性普遍面临着“不能显老”的压力。

13
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:59,460
At 28 and after 14 years, she decided to stop dying her hair and let her grey hair show.
28岁时，在坚持染发14年后，她决定不再染发，坦然露出白发。

14
00:01:59,460 --> 00:02:02,160
And she's not alone.
而这样做的并非只有她一人。

15
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:09,960
Since 2008, worldwide search interest in 'grey hair' has increased dramatically, Google Trends shows.
谷歌趋势数据显示，自2008年以来，全球对“白发”的搜索热度大幅上升。

16
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:17,710
This may have been driven by celebrities such as Ariana Grande and Lady Gaga, who have both had silver locks.
这可能是受到了爱莉安娜·格兰德和Lady Gaga等名人的推动，她们都曾留过银发造型。

17
00:02:17,710 --> 00:02:27,820
"People are torturing their hair to get the look," says renowned hair colourist Rita Hazan, who has worked with celebrities such as Beyoncé and Mariah Carey.
“人们为了打造这种造型，把头发折腾得够呛，”著名染发师丽塔·哈赞说，她曾为碧昂斯、玛丽亚·凯莉等名人服务。

18
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:40,420
Indeed, this trend was what persuaded 30-year-old Stephanie Tunchez from Texas to stop dying her natural hair two-and-a-half years ago.
事实上，正是这一趋势促使30岁的得克萨斯州人斯蒂芬妮·通切斯在两年半前停止了染发，回归自然发色。

19
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:47,360
But to many women, the transition is not an easy one.
但对许多女性来说，从染发过渡到自然白发并非易事。

20
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:52,330
Indeed, Kate experienced doubt from others with her initial decision.
事实上，凯特最初做出这个决定时，就遭到了他人的质疑。

21
00:02:52,330 --> 00:02:55,130
"People were like, 'Are you sure?
“人们会说‘你确定吗？

22
00:02:55,130 --> 00:02:56,240
What about your career?
你的事业怎么办？

23
00:02:56,240 --> 00:03:00,900
You're so young!' Like that seems silly," she reports.
你还这么年轻！’这话听着真可笑，”她回忆道。

24
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:06,650
She believes there needs to be better representation of grey-haired women of all ages.
她认为，各个年龄段的白发女性都需要更多的正面形象展示。

25
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:17,000
In this way it is hoped that, like many men, women will feel more confident about letting it show and will feel more comfortable going grey gracefully.
希望通过这种方式，女性也能像许多男性一样，更有信心展现自然白发，更从容地优雅老去。
